sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer as 买家
    actor Seller as 卖家
    participant UI as 评价页面
    participant API as ReviewController
    participant S as ReviewService
    participant DB as order/review tables
    Buyer->>UI: 查看可评价订单
    UI->>API: 提交评价
    API->>S: 校验完成订单和买家归属
    S->>DB: 保存评分和内容
    API-->>Buyer: 评价成功
    opt 允许追评
        Buyer->>API: 提交追评
        API->>S: 校验评价归属和时间
        S->>DB: 更新追评
    end
    Seller->>API: 回复评价
    API->>S: 校验商品/卖家归属
    S->>DB: 保存回复
    API-->>Seller: 回复成功
